-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError
-XX:HeapDumpPath=/path/to/dumps/heap-dump.hprof

# Exit on OOM to prevent zombie processes
-XX:+ExitOnOutOfMemoryError

# String deduplication (reduces memory for duplicate strings)
-XX:+UseStringDeduplication     # Java 8u20+

# Aggressive heap management
-XX:+UnlockExperimentalVMOptions
-XX:G1MixedGCLiveThresholdPercent=85
```

## Monitoring & Diagnostics

```bash
